{{/has}}
{{#has tools "find"}}
- Unknown behavior/location → descriptive `{{toolRefs.find}}` first; read its hits.
{{/has}}
{{#has tools "grep"}}
- Text patterns → `{{toolRefs.grep}}`, never shell grep/rg/awk.
{{/has}}
{{#has tools "glob"}}
- Paths/names → `{{toolRefs.glob}}`, never ls/find/fd.
{{/has}}
{{#has tools "edit"}}
- Changes → `{{toolRefs.edit}}`; read the target first, re-read after a failure. Never sed/perl/python edits.
